(3978875, 562227, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ecstasy in the form of a photograph. You go underneath expectation, underneath representation, underneath the real, and you find something more.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Ecstasy in the form of a photograph. You go underneath expectation, underneath representation, underneath the real, and you find something more. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon: ', '2007-08-08 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4007701, 569922, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is just pure visual delight for me and I hardly know why. It''s something I feel. It feels good the way a splash of water feels good. You have transcended representation in that way, and yet I see a hundred stories coyly represented here. You get the ribbon rouge.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is just pure visual delight for me and I hardly know why. It''s something I feel. It feels good the way a splash of water feels good. You have transcended representation in that way, and yet I see a hundred stories coyly represented here. You get the ribbon rouge. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2007-08-17 20:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4007705, 570120, 50695, '<td valign="top">It was so ridiculous of you to take this picture, and then, once you took it, the picture became inevitable.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'It was so ridiculous of you to take this picture, and then, once you took it, the picture became inevitable. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon ', '2007-08-17 20:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011577, 570683, 50695, '<td valign="top">For forcing an image where there was none, for creating a world that does not exist, for taking a picture of my own mind looking at a picture, I present you<br/> <br/>The Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'For forcing an image where there was none, for creating a world that does not exist, for taking a picture of my own mind looking at a picture, I present you The Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-08-19 17:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4018838, 569476, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the title. kitschy but still every inch a poem. I suppose it''s the faux horizon in the mirror that really sells me (and also makes it a landscape in my admittedly skewed eyes)<br/> <br/>ok, Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I love the title. kitschy but still every inch a poem. I suppose it''s the faux horizon in the mirror that really sells me (and also makes it a landscape in my admittedly skewed eyes) ok, Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-08-21 23:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
