(4030454, 572984, 50695, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=6999" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">e301</a> told me you missed the decisive moment, that she''s half a step away from where the wing would truly seem connected to her back, but I like the slight disconnection, and I like being able to see the full curve of the wing and how it interacts with the curve of her back. It is a conceptual connection. He may, after all, be right, but I''ll never know. I only have what is in front of me, and I dig it.<br/> <br/>You know, I was thinking of not giving you the blue after what Ed said, but really the man should have his own ribbons. Seriously. I would love to see his choices each week. For now, we''re stuck with mine:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', ' e301 told me you missed the decisive moment, that she''s half a step away from where the wing would truly seem connected to her back, but I like the slight disconnection, and I like being able to see the full curve of the wing and how it interacts with the curve of her back. It is a conceptual connection. He may, after all, be right, but I''ll never know. I only have what is in front of me, and I dig it. You know, I was thinking of not giving you the blue after what Ed said, but really the man should have his own ribbons. Seriously. I would love to see his choices each week. For now, we''re stuck with mine: ', '2007-08-26 19:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4030458, 570894, 50695, '<td valign="top">When you wish upon a shadow, <br/>it makes no difference. You will receive<br/>the shadow of your dream.<br/> <br/>A Posthumous Red Ribbon for you:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'When you wish upon a shadow, it makes no difference. You will receivethe shadow of your dream. A Posthumous Red Ribbon for you: ', '2007-08-26 20:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4030461, 573995, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m very fond of this because I''ve always made the same connection. Or maybe I never made the connection but after your photo it seems so obvious that I think I always made that connection. This is truly the sublime flying up from the mundane, transcendence without absence.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I''m very fond of this because I''ve always made the same connection. Or maybe I never made the connection but after your photo it seems so obvious that I think I always made that connection. This is truly the sublime flying up from the mundane, transcendence without absence. ', '2007-08-26 20:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036517, 577659, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a tremendous portrait and unlike some other shots, even some really good shots, this truly benefits from filling the frame. 10<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>I think what I like best about it is that he doesn''t seem like a photographer at all. There''s something so casual about how he has thrust the camera to his face. But casual is not the right word. He seems like an amateur in the very best sense. He is only taking a picture because a picture has presented itself. And once he''s done, he will casually throw the camera to his nervous sidekick and get back to his card game.</td>', 'This is a tremendous portrait and unlike some other shots, even some really good shots, this truly benefits from filling the frame. 10 Posthumous Blue Ribbon:   I think what I like best about it is that he doesn''t seem like a photographer at all. There''s something so casual about how he has thrust the camera to his face. But casual is not the right word. He seems like an amateur in the very best sense. He is only taking a picture because a picture has presented itself. And once he''s done, he will casually throw the camera to his nervous sidekick and get back to his card game.', '2007-08-28 22:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036522, 577624, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow. Just wow. 10<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>This is like Levi-Strauss meets Mondrian</td>', 'Wow. Just wow. 10 Posthumous Red Ribbon   This is like Levi-Strauss meets Mondrian', '2007-08-28 22:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
