(4058791, 577960, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is probably going to get the real blue ribbon because it is simply a perfect take on the challenge, but just in case it doesn''t, I''ll give it a Posthumous Blue Ribbon. And yes, I know what I''m risking here. After all this could be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/17203.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/17203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/17203.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=17203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">scalvert</a>. And that title is trying too hard. And I have two other brilliant photos to give this ribbon to. <br/> <br/>But the tension here is incredible. The hunger in that cat''s eyes...<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is probably going to get the real blue ribbon because it is simply a perfect take on the challenge, but just in case it doesn''t, I''ll give it a Posthumous Blue Ribbon. And yes, I know what I''m risking here. After all this could be  scalvert. And that title is trying too hard. And I have two other brilliant photos to give this ribbon to.  But the tension here is incredible. The hunger in that cat''s eyes... Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-09-05 00:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
