(4123161, 590470, 50695, '<td valign="top">An astonishing photograph. "I hardly can believe it''s real," as the poet says. I simply must give this the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'An astonishing photograph. "I hardly can believe it''s real," as the poet says. I simply must give this the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2007-09-28 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123162, 590885, 50695, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Perfect fulfillment of the challenge, and a bold yet simple, exciting yet elegant composition. A truly modern sensibility, an acknowledgment of classical values and yet a radical negligence of what is expected. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Stunning. Perfect fulfillment of the challenge, and a bold yet simple, exciting yet elegant composition. A truly modern sensibility, an acknowledgment of classical values and yet a radical negligence of what is expected. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you. ', '2007-09-28 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4123163, 589937, 50695, '<td valign="top">pure poetry in its purely visual way. Time is a mirror that turns things upside-down instead of backwards. The pendulum points to what you call the past, but the present in the crystal ball is now the past as well, is now a photograph as well. The red tide comes to claim them all.<br/> <br/>and a Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'pure poetry in its purely visual way. Time is a mirror that turns things upside-down instead of backwards. The pendulum points to what you call the past, but the present in the crystal ball is now the past as well, is now a photograph as well. The red tide comes to claim them all. and a Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you. ', '2007-09-28 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135120, 591590, 50695, '<td valign="top">this stunned me right from the thumbnail. Brilliant. Thank you!<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> Posthumous Blue Ribbon</td>', 'this stunned me right from the thumbnail. Brilliant. Thank you!  Posthumous Blue Ribbon', '2007-10-02 23:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135125, 591574, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is insane. I love it, of course.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> Posthumous Red Ribbon</td>', 'Wow. This is insane. I love it, of course.  Posthumous Red Ribbon', '2007-10-02 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135127, 589114, 50695, '<td valign="top">The wannabe Goths could learn a thing or two from you. This is spot on Noir scariness. I want to see this movie.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/> Posthumous Yellow Ribbon</td>', 'The wannabe Goths could learn a thing or two from you. This is spot on Noir scariness. I want to see this movie.  Posthumous Yellow Ribbon', '2007-10-02 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149797, 592138, 50695, '<td valign="top">Why this shot is a TEN:<br/> <br/>-I''ve never seen a walrus look like that before, with his head so well defined and personified.<br/>-a mirroring between person and walrus, but something more profound than a mere fat joke, though it''s that, too, but not a derisive one, perhaps because the walrus is so noble.<br/>-the beautiful mist of water drops like falling stars<br/> <br/>and those are also the reasons this gets a Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Why this shot is a TEN: -I''ve never seen a walrus look like that before, with his head so well defined and personified.-a mirroring between person and walrus, but something more profound than a mere fat joke, though it''s that, too, but not a derisive one, perhaps because the walrus is so noble.-the beautiful mist of water drops like falling stars and those are also the reasons this gets a Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2007-10-07 18:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149799, 593176, 50695, '<td valign="top">the background seems so OOF and so far away and so impossible to reach, yet I can tell exactly what it is and its shapes dominate the composition. The overall effect is a visual paradox that is totally compelling and creates questions about the child... what world does he exist in? what time? Is this a world of his past, his future, a world he abandoned, a world that rejected him? His expression, so intense but completely ambiguous (polyguous?), only intensifies the mystery.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> (yes there is another photo as good as this one!)</td>', 'the background seems so OOF and so far away and so impossible to reach, yet I can tell exactly what it is and its shapes dominate the composition. The overall effect is a visual paradox that is totally compelling and creates questions about the child... what world does he exist in? what time? Is this a world of his past, his future, a world he abandoned, a world that rejected him? His expression, so intense but completely ambiguous (polyguous?), only intensifies the mystery. Posthumous Red Ribbon  (yes there is another photo as good as this one!)', '2007-10-07 18:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149801, 592872, 50695, '<td valign="top">ecstatic, frightening, impossible (and then I see the boy yelling! I was already giving you a 10. an 11?). Logically I know she is jumping off the pole, but visually/viscerally/emotionally I cannot accept that. I can only see her flying.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> Posthumous Blue Ribbon</td>', 'ecstatic, frightening, impossible (and then I see the boy yelling! I was already giving you a 10. an 11?). Logically I know she is jumping off the pole, but visually/viscerally/emotionally I cannot accept that. I can only see her flying.  Posthumous Blue Ribbon', '2007-10-07 18:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4167758, 596782, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is just by far the best in the challenge but since you so unwisely showed it to me beforehand I can only give you the ALMOST BLUE:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/almostblue.gif'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/almostblue.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/almostblue.gif"/></td>', 'This is just by far the best in the challenge but since you so unwisely showed it to me beforehand I can only give you the ALMOST BLUE: ', '2007-10-15 00:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186171, 599783, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is like a whole little world. the world is a stage. Tim Burton''s got nothing on you.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is like a whole little world. the world is a stage. Tim Burton''s got nothing on you. Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2007-10-22 00:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4207020, 604831, 50695, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/>Duh, I thought this challenge was ending and I was in a hurry. Ah, so now I can breathe, relax, and tell you what incredible photojournalism this is, and also art. You''ve caught this moment within a moment, a moment of awareness of YOU caught inside a moment of searching, a moment before she becomes self-conscious, when she is searching for a connection, a meaning, and she looks up in that search, away from what she thought she was searching for. The symphony of subject in context here is unmistakable, inevitable, surprising.</td>', ' Posthumous Blue Ribbon Duh, I thought this challenge was ending and I was in a hurry. Ah, so now I can breathe, relax, and tell you what incredible photojournalism this is, and also art. You''ve caught this moment within a moment, a moment of awareness of YOU caught inside a moment of searching, a moment before she becomes self-conscious, when she is searching for a connection, a meaning, and she looks up in that search, away from what she thought she was searching for. The symphony of subject in context here is unmistakable, inevitable, surprising.', '2007-10-31 00:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213872, 604749, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and it is definitely journalism. This one-two punch nets you the Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Beautiful photo and it is definitely journalism. This one-two punch nets you the Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2007-11-01 21:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213886, 602939, 50695, '<td valign="top">great shot. Wonderful use of layers to tell a story. As with my other ribbon picks, this photo is beautiful regardless of the challenge. But it also fits the challenge perfectly. I could easily imagine this in a weekly news magazing or the cover of the Times (not that this story would make the cover of the Times, sadly).<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'great shot. Wonderful use of layers to tell a story. As with my other ribbon picks, this photo is beautiful regardless of the challenge. But it also fits the challenge perfectly. I could easily imagine this in a weekly news magazing or the cover of the Times (not that this story would make the cover of the Times, sadly). Posthumous Yellow Ribbon ', '2007-11-01 22:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4230384, 605044, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is why I stay at DPC. Every once in a while I will see something that is like nothing I''ve ever seen before, and yet is so familiar as to be a part of me. I can sometimes say why a photo is good but I could never express or even understand what makes a photo the best of the best.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is why I stay at DPC. Every once in a while I will see something that is like nothing I''ve ever seen before, and yet is so familiar as to be a part of me. I can sometimes say why a photo is good but I could never express or even understand what makes a photo the best of the best. Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-11-07 22:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4230400, 604813, 50695, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this ridiculous, pointless photo. Somehow, by being nothing, you have become everything.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I keep coming back to this ridiculous, pointless photo. Somehow, by being nothing, you have become everything. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2007-11-07 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4230412, 603835, 50695, '<td valign="top">a truly lovely portrait. The tones are great. You took the highlights and shadows as far as they could go without losing the softness. The end result is a tangible three-dimensional feel. The composition is simple and straightforward, but also elegant, and just enough of the car is hinted at to give her a setting. Ditto for the grassy background. There''s something very American about it, but the tones seem like early-20th-century Europe, for some reason. Wow, I like this photo more the more I look at it and write about it. I swear it''s turning into a movie. She''s talking English but I can''t figure out whether this is an American movie or an American character in a French movie (played by a French actress).<br/> <br/>I was having a very difficult time picking my yellow ribbon winner. I finally chose this one simply because it is so moving.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'a truly lovely portrait. The tones are great. You took the highlights and shadows as far as they could go without losing the softness. The end result is a tangible three-dimensional feel. The composition is simple and straightforward, but also elegant, and just enough of the car is hinted at to give her a setting. Ditto for the grassy background. There''s something very American about it, but the tones seem like early-20th-century Europe, for some reason. Wow, I like this photo more the more I look at it and write about it. I swear it''s turning into a movie. She''s talking English but I can''t figure out whether this is an American movie or an American character in a French movie (played by a French actress). I was having a very difficult time picking my yellow ribbon winner. I finally chose this one simply because it is so moving. ', '2007-11-07 22:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4255351, 610641, 50695, '<td valign="top">I feel sad for the people who didn''t give this a 10. The door was open for them into a frightening beautiful universe, and they decided not to enter. The moment I looked at this photo I knew it was the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I feel sad for the people who didn''t give this a 10. The door was open for them into a frightening beautiful universe, and they decided not to enter. The moment I looked at this photo I knew it was the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2007-11-18 11:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4255357, 611825, 50695, '<td valign="top">perfectly framed, perfectly compositioned, perfectly captured.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'perfectly framed, perfectly compositioned, perfectly captured. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2007-11-18 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4255358, 609982, 50695, '<td valign="top">Layers upon layers, worlds upon worlds.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Layers upon layers, worlds upon worlds. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2007-11-18 11:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4281630, 616690, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love a photo that I have never seen before, not on any planet. This is Jean Cocteau''s version of the Matrix.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I love a photo that I have never seen before, not on any planet. This is Jean Cocteau''s version of the Matrix. Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-12-02 00:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4281633, 615629, 50695, '<td valign="top">The other ribbon I gave was for sheer lunacy. This one is for sheer mastery.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon - <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'The other ribbon I gave was for sheer lunacy. This one is for sheer mastery. Posthumous Red Ribbon - ', '2007-12-02 00:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4281643, 616699, 50695, '<td valign="top">So mundane, yet so strangely beautiful (or beautifully strange). There''s that word: SPIRIT. It''s the only word you need.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon - <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'So mundane, yet so strangely beautiful (or beautifully strange). There''s that word: SPIRIT. It''s the only word you need. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon - ', '2007-12-02 00:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289588, 617349, 50695, '<td valign="top">This photo is fun and fascinating on its own, and is even more intriguing in the context of the challenge. The way she becomes part of the painting, or rather, the painting becomes part of her, makes her alone in its crowd. The way her hair becomes his, making him alone... there''s a poignant sort of sharing of aloneness here, something hopeful about it. And then you framed the picture the same way the painting is framed.<br/> <br/>But most of all, it''s unique, original, unlike anything I''ve seen before. So I''m giving you my own personal ribbon, the Posthumous Blue.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This photo is fun and fascinating on its own, and is even more intriguing in the context of the challenge. The way she becomes part of the painting, or rather, the painting becomes part of her, makes her alone in its crowd. The way her hair becomes his, making him alone... there''s a poignant sort of sharing of aloneness here, something hopeful about it. And then you framed the picture the same way the painting is framed. But most of all, it''s unique, original, unlike anything I''ve seen before. So I''m giving you my own personal ribbon, the Posthumous Blue. ', '2007-12-04 23:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289589, 616408, 50695, '<td valign="top">Perfect execution of the challenge, masterful photo with a tremendous depth of field and a depth of interest just as deep. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Perfect execution of the challenge, masterful photo with a tremendous depth of field and a depth of interest just as deep. The Posthumous Red Ribbon for you. ', '2007-12-04 23:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4289592, 617256, 50695, '<td valign="top">Love the organic curves, and the challenge conveyed with the minimum information possible, but even in all this darkness you still convey the lusciousness of the fountain. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Love the organic curves, and the challenge conveyed with the minimum information possible, but even in all this darkness you still convey the lusciousness of the fountain. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2007-12-04 23:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299925, 617002, 50695, '<td valign="top">The lovers, surrounded by a dreamworld (their future) on one side and a reflecting shopwindow of fantasies on the other. This is an insanely good photograph, and more than a photograph.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> Posthumous Blue Ribbon</td>', 'The lovers, surrounded by a dreamworld (their future) on one side and a reflecting shopwindow of fantasies on the other. This is an insanely good photograph, and more than a photograph.  Posthumous Blue Ribbon', '2007-12-07 19:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4299929, 612843, 50695, '<td valign="top">Bizarre yet inevitable composition. This is what Ed Clarke dreamed last night. How did you get into his brain?<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/> Posthumous Yellow Ribbon</td>', 'Bizarre yet inevitable composition. This is what Ed Clarke dreamed last night. How did you get into his brain?  Posthumous Yellow Ribbon', '2007-12-07 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
