(4429759, 635622, 50695, '<td valign="top">It was a moment when there was only you and I, when I didn''t know which stripes were yours and which were mine. Sunlight fell on us like rain and we danced in its puddles. We trust our memory of such moments because otherwise we wouldn''t dare to believe they could exist.<br/> <br/>There is a magic to the way you edited this. It doesn''t seem real. I''m giving you the Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'It was a moment when there was only you and I, when I didn''t know which stripes were yours and which were mine. Sunlight fell on us like rain and we danced in its puddles. We trust our memory of such moments because otherwise we wouldn''t dare to believe they could exist. There is a magic to the way you edited this. It doesn''t seem real. I''m giving you the Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2008-01-27 18:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
