(4573266, 655628, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> the colours in this are simply wonderful, the glowing gold and icy blue.  i only just realised what this actually is, so the abstraction is superb too.</td>', ' the colours in this are simply wonderful, the glowing gold and icy blue.  i only just realised what this actually is, so the abstraction is superb too.', '2008-03-19 07:51:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4573268, 656781, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> i have no idea what this is, but that doesn''t matter.  the sweep of gold through the dark is enough.  and i''m not talking about the monty python version either.</td>', ' i have no idea what this is, but that doesn''t matter.  the sweep of gold through the dark is enough.  and i''m not talking about the monty python version either.', '2008-03-19 07:52:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4582655, 658731, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> as an ex-cycle courier, this image really resonates.  the darkness, while criticised by many, epitomises the grimy reality of urban cycling, as does the face mask.  i love the zooming composition, the texture of the wall, and the touch of red in the reflector.</td>', ' as an ex-cycle courier, this image really resonates.  the darkness, while criticised by many, epitomises the grimy reality of urban cycling, as does the face mask.  i love the zooming composition, the texture of the wall, and the touch of red in the reflector.', '2008-03-24 07:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4584075, 659345, 50695, '<td valign="top">This should be her business card. It''s so mysterious and yet so clearly about an artist. You have the artist at work and the artist seeking inspiration.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This should be her business card. It''s so mysterious and yet so clearly about an artist. You have the artist at work and the artist seeking inspiration. Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2008-03-24 19:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4584076, 657185, 50695, '<td valign="top">An amazing sense of motion. He seems to be firing through the trees like laser beams. The way he interacts with his environment and yet seems to be not in it is startling.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'An amazing sense of motion. He seems to be firing through the trees like laser beams. The way he interacts with his environment and yet seems to be not in it is startling. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2008-03-24 19:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4584081, 658557, 50695, '<td valign="top">A woman lost in her environment. Terrific capture.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'A woman lost in her environment. Terrific capture. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon ', '2008-03-24 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592280, 661729, 50695, '<td valign="top">brilliant photojournalism. beautiful photo.<br/> <br/>Man, there is nothing even close to this in the rest of the challenge. I hope you get the blue. In the meantime I''m giving you my blue.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'brilliant photojournalism. beautiful photo. Man, there is nothing even close to this in the rest of the challenge. I hope you get the blue. In the meantime I''m giving you my blue. ', '2008-03-27 19:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592286, 661754, 50695, '<td valign="top">I could have been in this same location and no way would I have come up with this photograph. This is simply great photography. The posthumous blue went to a great photograph with a strong connection to the challenge. The red goes to a great photograph with a so-so connection to the challenge. You.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I could have been in this same location and no way would I have come up with this photograph. This is simply great photography. The posthumous blue went to a great photograph with a strong connection to the challenge. The red goes to a great photograph with a so-so connection to the challenge. You. ', '2008-03-27 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592566, 661577, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can hear the whisper. it sounds like sunlight.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I can hear the whisper. it sounds like sunlight. ', '2008-03-27 22:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4599189, 657866, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> the night, red and black, the dirt and grime, arresting, voting, important stuff happening here.   a lovely, deep and dark image.</td>', ' the night, red and black, the dirt and grime, arresting, voting, important stuff happening here.   a lovely, deep and dark image.', '2008-03-31 14:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606057, 661508, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> i love close-ups of things.  you have turned a small marshmallow candy to a monumental object.  the texture of the sugar on the surface is tangible.  nice one.</td>', ' i love close-ups of things.  you have turned a small marshmallow candy to a monumental object.  the texture of the sugar on the surface is tangible.  nice one.', '2008-04-02 09:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4620197, 663871, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> shows how much i know - i thought this was really dpc friendly.  the buttery feel of the guitar is just scrummy.  i love the soft, gentle curves; the colours and tones are just superb.</td>', ' shows how much i know - i thought this was really dpc friendly.  the buttery feel of the guitar is just scrummy.  i love the soft, gentle curves; the colours and tones are just superb.', '2008-04-07 06:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4620199, 661687, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> i thought i recognised this one, and was right.  so simple and clean, pure and lovely.  anthropomorphism at its best.</td>', ' i thought i recognised this one, and was right.  so simple and clean, pure and lovely.  anthropomorphism at its best.', '2008-04-07 06:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4620202, 663577, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> this is just so cool.  i love the abstract shapes, the smooth tones, and the tone reversal.  the swoop of the curve is so dramatic and... swoopy.</td>', ' this is just so cool.  i love the abstract shapes, the smooth tones, and the tone reversal.  the swoop of the curve is so dramatic and... swoopy.', '2008-04-07 06:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4620204, 662658, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> man, what is with people?  such lovely colours, the contrasting textures, the dramatic blue sky with swirly clouds - i figured this for a dpc fave.  obviously not.  fools.</td>', ' man, what is with people?  such lovely colours, the contrasting textures, the dramatic blue sky with swirly clouds - i figured this for a dpc fave.  obviously not.  fools.', '2008-04-07 06:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4620206, 662609, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> soft curves and harsh concrete, deep sky with wispy clouds, dark, brooding tones.  excellent city shot and abstract composition.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-07 05:15:39.</i></td>', ' soft curves and harsh concrete, deep sky with wispy clouds, dark, brooding tones.  excellent city shot and abstract composition.', '2008-04-07 06:14:50.000000', '2008-04-07 06:15:39.000000', 0),
(4622549, 660130, 50695, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo. Seems like an obvious ribbon to me but I''m guessing the lack of eye contact will befuddle the DPC voters.<br/> <br/>I think there''s supposed to be logic to my ribbon picking, but I swear that the Posthumous blue ribbon usually goes to the image that demands it. <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Amazing photo. Seems like an obvious ribbon to me but I''m guessing the lack of eye contact will befuddle the DPC voters. I think there''s supposed to be logic to my ribbon picking, but I swear that the Posthumous blue ribbon usually goes to the image that demands it.  ', '2008-04-08 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4622556, 661561, 50695, '<td valign="top">amazing capture. I feel like I''m on some nutty nature show, about to get killed.<br/> <br/>I just can''t get over this shot. I have some red for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'amazing capture. I feel like I''m on some nutty nature show, about to get killed. I just can''t get over this shot. I have some red for you. ', '2008-04-08 00:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
