(4681601, 673353, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> ooo, this is deeply funky.  i love the tracery of the ball paths and the wide angle forced perspective.  i think this might be technically better with slightly more contrast, or deeper tones, but i really enjoy intellectually as it is.  nice one!</td>', ' ooo, this is deeply funky.  i love the tracery of the ball paths and the wide angle forced perspective.  i think this might be technically better with slightly more contrast, or deeper tones, but i really enjoy intellectually as it is.  nice one!', '2008-05-05 11:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
