(4997793, 725976, 50695, '<td valign="top">part of me says don''t be too impressed this is just an aquarium shot, but damn this shot is special. It keeps drawing me in with some sort of fairy tale mysticism. So you''ve forced it out of me: a Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>The texture, the title, the humorous way he fills up the entire frame even though he is supposedly in "flight"... these are the touches that take it over the top.</td>', 'part of me says don''t be too impressed this is just an aquarium shot, but damn this shot is special. It keeps drawing me in with some sort of fairy tale mysticism. So you''ve forced it out of me: a Posthumous Red Ribbon.   The texture, the title, the humorous way he fills up the entire frame even though he is supposedly in "flight"... these are the touches that take it over the top.', '2008-10-07 23:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4997797, 726859, 50695, '<td valign="top">There is something so classic about this photo, I have to give it a ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'There is something so classic about this photo, I have to give it a ribbon. ', '2008-10-07 23:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
