(5161682, 750454, 50695, '<td valign="top">That face, that face, that fabulous face! Those fruit, those fruit...<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. Not the most original shot, but perfectly executed and original in the sense that it''s a real moment captured.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'That face, that face, that fabulous face! Those fruit, those fruit... Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. Not the most original shot, but perfectly executed and original in the sense that it''s a real moment captured. ', '2009-01-01 01:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163910, 751547, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for moths. And you''ve framed him perfectly. This is simple but mysterious. It has that sublime feeling of being carefully planned yet insane at the same time. The textures and tones are gorgeous and outrageous. I only wish my soul had such a home.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I''m a sucker for moths. And you''ve framed him perfectly. This is simple but mysterious. It has that sublime feeling of being carefully planned yet insane at the same time. The textures and tones are gorgeous and outrageous. I only wish my soul had such a home. Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-01-01 19:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163919, 750097, 50695, '<td valign="top">Now you''re talking. The fish are perfectly clear and the lady is distorted (but not dim!). This is a nicely balanced photo and the darkness serves you by eliminating distractions and making the water seemingly endless. <br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Now you''re talking. The fish are perfectly clear and the lady is distorted (but not dim!). This is a nicely balanced photo and the darkness serves you by eliminating distractions and making the water seemingly endless.  Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2009-01-01 19:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5163925, 750508, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ultimately, a photograph isn''t about settings or rules or even tools. Ultimately, it is a vision and a moment come together. This is just such a photo. Funny, I just talked myself into thinking this is the best photo in the challenge, but I''ve already given blue and red to two stunning photographs, so all I can give you is all I have, which I give gladly. The Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Ultimately, a photograph isn''t about settings or rules or even tools. Ultimately, it is a vision and a moment come together. This is just such a photo. Funny, I just talked myself into thinking this is the best photo in the challenge, but I''ve already given blue and red to two stunning photographs, so all I can give you is all I have, which I give gladly. The Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2009-01-01 19:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
