(5179231, 751675, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the world of shadows, where puppets live without masters. I love to see a window latch reaching for freedom.<br/> <br/>There are pictures that make you want to live in their world. Then there are pictures that show you the world you''ve been living in all your life but hadn''t seen yet. Those are the ones that get blue ribbons.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I love the world of shadows, where puppets live without masters. I love to see a window latch reaching for freedom. There are pictures that make you want to live in their world. Then there are pictures that show you the world you''ve been living in all your life but hadn''t seen yet. Those are the ones that get blue ribbons. Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-01-07 22:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5179235, 746928, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful geometrical abstract. I can see colors.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'wonderful geometrical abstract. I can see colors. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-01-07 22:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
