(5236174, 761570, 50695, '<td valign="top">This was an easy pick for me: Posthumous Blue Ribbon. Not only do you create a new visual language, you provide the alphabet!<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This was an easy pick for me: Posthumous Blue Ribbon. Not only do you create a new visual language, you provide the alphabet! ', '2009-02-02 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5236182, 760583, 50695, '<td valign="top">This portrait is so menacing. I get the impression he''s wearing a new shirt that his lawyer provided for him. His expression is ageless, and terrifying. I give this my Posthumous Red Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This portrait is so menacing. I get the impression he''s wearing a new shirt that his lawyer provided for him. His expression is ageless, and terrifying. I give this my Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2009-02-02 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5236214, 758687, 50695, '<td valign="top">disturbing and beautiful at the same time. the concept makes me suspicious, like it could have been done before. But what takes me over the top is the unusual lighting and what it does to his left eye. There is a hidden expression in this face, eyes wide open in (to) another universe. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'disturbing and beautiful at the same time. the concept makes me suspicious, like it could have been done before. But what takes me over the top is the unusual lighting and what it does to his left eye. There is a hidden expression in this face, eyes wide open in (to) another universe. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2009-02-02 22:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5240114, 761581, 50695, '<td valign="top">Hell yeah, you''re my Posthumous Blue. No question. Breathtaking.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Hell yeah, you''re my Posthumous Blue. No question. Breathtaking. ', '2009-02-04 23:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242469, 762001, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is subtle and unpretentious, but perfectly fulfills the challenge. There''s a sense that most people have cleared out. The scene, whatever it was, is over. The fact that she''s sitting on the floor puts her in tension against that movement, as if she''s not ready for it to be over. Visually, there is emptiness behind her, representing a sort of stasis she has achieved in the face of this ending, which she is on the fringe of. For a moment, SHE is the audience, and the chairs act out their little dance, pirhouetting through sunlight and waxed reflections.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'this is subtle and unpretentious, but perfectly fulfills the challenge. There''s a sense that most people have cleared out. The scene, whatever it was, is over. The fact that she''s sitting on the floor puts her in tension against that movement, as if she''s not ready for it to be over. Visually, there is emptiness behind her, representing a sort of stasis she has achieved in the face of this ending, which she is on the fringe of. For a moment, SHE is the audience, and the chairs act out their little dance, pirhouetting through sunlight and waxed reflections. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2009-02-06 13:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242514, 761947, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I''m giving a blue ribbon to a picture of a pregnant woman. <br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon - <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I can''t believe I''m giving a blue ribbon to a picture of a pregnant woman.  Posthumous Blue Ribbon - ', '2009-02-06 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242517, 761927, 50695, '<td valign="top">This does look like a dream of tuna. There is an amazing, explosive flow to the lines of this composition. Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This does look like a dream of tuna. There is an amazing, explosive flow to the lines of this composition. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-02-06 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5242518, 761335, 50695, '<td valign="top">Your title is perfect. The skyline hints at where the birds should be. The sense of not flying is palpable.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon  <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Your title is perfect. The skyline hints at where the birds should be. The sense of not flying is palpable. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon  ', '2009-02-06 14:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
