(5344076, 772130, 50695, '<td valign="top">Surrealism through fakeness... evoking very real feelings with artifice. Your title matches the mood. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Surrealism through fakeness... evoking very real feelings with artifice. Your title matches the mood. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2009-03-13 23:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5344098, 772434, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why I love Manet so much more than his contemporaries. I have no idea why I need to give this a ribbon. Everything is so accidental and so perfect at the same time... including the light. the colors are exquisite. I''m just speechless about this. It''s... it''s.. Vermeer meets Gerber''s.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I have no idea why I love Manet so much more than his contemporaries. I have no idea why I need to give this a ribbon. Everything is so accidental and so perfect at the same time... including the light. the colors are exquisite. I''m just speechless about this. It''s... it''s.. Vermeer meets Gerber''s. ', '2009-03-13 23:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
