(5415067, 778574, 50695, '<td valign="top">WOW. I''ll be back for this one.<br/> <br/>If this is who I think it is, you owe some serious chocolate. At least you made the choice for blue an easy one.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'WOW. I''ll be back for this one. If this is who I think it is, you owe some serious chocolate. At least you made the choice for blue an easy one. Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-04-02 14:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5415072, 778560, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s odd the subtleties that differentiate a snapshot from greatness. There is the parallelism of legs with tent spokes, the fake stars, the intense yet smooth b/w conversion... and many things I don''t even realize. I just know the greatness. I give you my red ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'It''s odd the subtleties that differentiate a snapshot from greatness. There is the parallelism of legs with tent spokes, the fake stars, the intense yet smooth b/w conversion... and many things I don''t even realize. I just know the greatness. I give you my red ribbon. ', '2009-04-02 14:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420349, 777574, 50695, '<td valign="top">holy cow. I''ll be back for this one.<br/> <br/>I can''t resist a good hat. Posthumous Blue Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'holy cow. I''ll be back for this one. I can''t resist a good hat. Posthumous Blue Ribbon for you. ', '2009-04-05 23:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420353, 777477, 50695, '<td valign="top">Time, that endless (or is it endful?) progression. But there is no end to your photograph: the head is gone and the destination of the stairway is gone. The illusion of infinity is created through violence. Reminds me of religion.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Time, that endless (or is it endful?) progression. But there is no end to your photograph: the head is gone and the destination of the stairway is gone. The illusion of infinity is created through violence. Reminds me of religion. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-04-05 23:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
