(5437583, 779051, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice! The camera actually simulates the petting of a dog. We''re not merely seeing a texture, we''re experiencing it vicariously. In other words, you''re conveying not just the surface, but <i>how the surface is being touched</i>.<br/> <br/>I''m giving you a Posthumous Blue Ribbon simply for fulfilling the challenge in such an exquisite way.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Nice! The camera actually simulates the petting of a dog. We''re not merely seeing a texture, we''re experiencing it vicariously. In other words, you''re conveying not just the surface, but how the surface is being touched. I''m giving you a Posthumous Blue Ribbon simply for fulfilling the challenge in such an exquisite way. ', '2009-04-15 00:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437621, 780096, 50695, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo. The photo itself has a texture. Beautiful.<br/> <br/>This picture makes me feel good. I''m giving it a ribbon.<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077286" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077286.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077286.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077286.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-11-29 18:54:56.</i></td>', 'A lovely photo. The photo itself has a texture. Beautiful. This picture makes me feel good. I''m giving it a ribbon. ', '2009-04-15 00:27:42.000000', '2019-11-29 18:54:56.000000', 1),
