(5559811, 802513, 50695, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal. The sense of pespective is earth-shattering, with your fragile subject at the hinge of chaos.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Phenomenal. The sense of pespective is earth-shattering, with your fragile subject at the hinge of chaos. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2009-07-05 01:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559816, 801906, 50695, '<td valign="top">Visionary... real and flat ... Buster Keaton is hiding in that boat from Keystone Kops who will never come. The boat is resting. The photo is resting. This is good, because my eyes are tired of being told what to do. Sometimes you have to say to a boat that you just don''t want to go anywhere. Some of us enjoy the threshold between land and water. We don''t want to shove off. We like it here.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Visionary... real and flat ... Buster Keaton is hiding in that boat from Keystone Kops who will never come. The boat is resting. The photo is resting. This is good, because my eyes are tired of being told what to do. Sometimes you have to say to a boat that you just don''t want to go anywhere. Some of us enjoy the threshold between land and water. We don''t want to shove off. We like it here. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2009-07-05 01:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5563526, 801477, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m having a raging argument with myself over this picture. My left brain says I''ve seen it before. But my eyes say, no, I have never seen this picture before. In fact, I''m hardly seeing it now. I think it''s because there''s glass where I don''t expect there to be glass, and reflections where I don''t expect there to be reflections. This is where my heart steps in and settles the matter. He is a fool for you. Maybe it''s the way the processing of the photo goes with the processing of the rain. Maybe it''s the creamy shadows. The photo simply has the heart and authority to demand a blue ribbon, so I give it mine.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I''m having a raging argument with myself over this picture. My left brain says I''ve seen it before. But my eyes say, no, I have never seen this picture before. In fact, I''m hardly seeing it now. I think it''s because there''s glass where I don''t expect there to be glass, and reflections where I don''t expect there to be reflections. This is where my heart steps in and settles the matter. He is a fool for you. Maybe it''s the way the processing of the photo goes with the processing of the rain. Maybe it''s the creamy shadows. The photo simply has the heart and authority to demand a blue ribbon, so I give it mine. Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2009-07-07 22:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5563533, 803312, 50695, '<td valign="top">DPC has made me very cynical about deer, but the way the birds are part of the foliage is just an ecstatic thing to see, and resonates with the deer who is also so absorbed by his environment. It is indeed a visual poem. Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'DPC has made me very cynical about deer, but the way the birds are part of the foliage is just an ecstatic thing to see, and resonates with the deer who is also so absorbed by his environment. It is indeed a visual poem. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-07-07 22:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
