(5716838, 830343, 50695, '<td valign="top">ok, I''m sure this is going to score high, but I can''t ignore this coup de grace, either. I give you the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'ok, I''m sure this is going to score high, but I can''t ignore this coup de grace, either. I give you the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-11-06 19:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716846, 829133, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is very stimulating. It grabs hold of the viewer and inserts itself into his or her consciousness with more than a thimbleful of meaning. As soon as I finish this cigarette I give you the Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is very stimulating. It grabs hold of the viewer and inserts itself into his or her consciousness with more than a thimbleful of meaning. As soon as I finish this cigarette I give you the Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-11-06 19:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716852, 830076, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot to highlight a fascinating object. That in itself is not enough to win a Posthumous ribbon, but I find this photo emotionally satisfying as well, projecting some sort of world that I want to be in, so I give you a posthumous yellow ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is a good shot to highlight a fascinating object. That in itself is not enough to win a Posthumous ribbon, but I find this photo emotionally satisfying as well, projecting some sort of world that I want to be in, so I give you a posthumous yellow ribbon. ', '2009-11-06 19:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716857, 830126, 50695, '<td valign="top">stungering.<br/> <br/>mixtabulous.<br/> <br/>I''m  out of ribbons, but you know what? I''ll make an extra one for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'stungering. mixtabulous. I''m  out of ribbons, but you know what? I''ll make an extra one for you. ', '2009-11-06 19:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716862, 830337, 50695, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo. this makes me happy. What a great composition and use of sun. <br/> <br/>I''m giving out some extra yellows because I can''t NOT give this a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow the third:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Fantastic photo. this makes me happy. What a great composition and use of sun.  I''m giving out some extra yellows because I can''t NOT give this a ribbon. Posthumous Yellow the third: ', '2009-11-06 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717696, 830559, 50695, '<td valign="top">Subtlety is spooking. You get the Posthumous Boo Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/boopost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/boopost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/boopost.jpg"/></td>', 'Subtlety is spooking. You get the Posthumous Boo Ribbon. ', '2009-11-07 13:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717698, 830540, 50695, '<td valign="top">Camp is scary. You get the Posthumous Boo Ribbon. I can imagine this on a pulp fiction cover.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/boopost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/boopost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/boopost.jpg"/></td>', 'Camp is scary. You get the Posthumous Boo Ribbon. I can imagine this on a pulp fiction cover. ', '2009-11-07 13:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
