(5722181, 831438, 50695, '<td valign="top">I have to give this the Posthumous Blue. Holy cowabunga.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I have to give this the Posthumous Blue. Holy cowabunga. ', '2009-11-10 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722192, 831296, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is probably scoring well, but I can''t stop myself from heaping on yet more accolades: a Posthumous Red Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is probably scoring well, but I can''t stop myself from heaping on yet more accolades: a Posthumous Red Ribbon for you. ', '2009-11-10 21:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722197, 831347, 50695, '<td valign="top">This shot needs me.<br/> <br/>There are two outstanding things about this shot. The first is the title. The second is that the hand looks like yet another cloven hoof.<br/> <br/>I give you my Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This shot needs me. There are two outstanding things about this shot. The first is the title. The second is that the hand looks like yet another cloven hoof. I give you my Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2009-11-10 21:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722233, 831298, 50695, '<td valign="top">This has a way about it. I don''t know what it is. But I know that I can''t live without it. This has a tilt that moves me. And everywhere it goes a million dreams of light surround it everywhere. Air.<br/> <br/>Most originalness gets this the Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This has a way about it. I don''t know what it is. But I know that I can''t live without it. This has a tilt that moves me. And everywhere it goes a million dreams of light surround it everywhere. Air. Most originalness gets this the Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2009-11-10 22:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5722234, 831397, 50695, '<td valign="top">Striking elegance. I give this my red ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Striking elegance. I give this my red ribbon. ', '2009-11-10 22:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
