(5816200, 846294, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this not for itself but because it is so thoroughly something else, something one might find in an abandoned photo album, and you wonder why they kept this picture... you figure it''s because it captured some quality of the shore they wanted to remember, even if it was a bit sinister and desperate. Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I like this not for itself but because it is so thoroughly something else, something one might find in an abandoned photo album, and you wonder why they kept this picture... you figure it''s because it captured some quality of the shore they wanted to remember, even if it was a bit sinister and desperate. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2010-01-17 23:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
