(5819734, 846094, 103142, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually give bluebirds to top 10s, but this was just too wonderful to pass up. It feels kind of silly to give my award to someone whose profile is as incredible as yours -- but what the heck!<br/> <br/>You''ve just been awarded a bluebird!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=935058&amp;page=1#5819711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">link to the posthumous thread</a></td>', 'I don''t usually give bluebirds to top 10s, but this was just too wonderful to pass up. It feels kind of silly to give my award to someone whose profile is as incredible as yours -- but what the heck! You''ve just been awarded a bluebird!  link to the posthumous thread', '2010-01-20 13:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5819738, 846102, 103142, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful! I definitely needs a bluebird award!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=935058&amp;page=1#5819711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">link to the posthumous thread</a> <br/> <br/>I would really love to know how much was processing and how much it the photo itself. I really enjoyed the picture, and I''d like to know more about it.<br/> <br/>Beautifully done!</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful! I definitely needs a bluebird award!  link to the posthumous thread  I would really love to know how much was processing and how much it the photo itself. I really enjoyed the picture, and I''d like to know more about it. Beautifully done!', '2010-01-20 13:32:42.000000', NULL, 0);
