(6112675, 898687, 50695, '<td valign="top">These people are alive to me. I feel as if I know them. And we are beautiful together. This feels like outdoors and indoors at the same time. I give you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'These people are alive to me. I feel as if I know them. And we are beautiful together. This feels like outdoors and indoors at the same time. I give you my Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2010-08-02 00:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6122839, 900528, 100393, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=859062" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859062.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859062.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_859062.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Awarded for July 2010</td>', '  Awarded for July 2010', '2010-08-08 09:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6125617, 899343, 32011, '<td valign="top">Now I''m pretty sure I gave THIS one a MUAIMHO... so will kill two birds with one stone (MUAIMHO notification and PAW2010 comment).<br/> <br/>I''m happy to present this image with a MUAIMHO award, as I am of the opinion that it was amongst the Most Under Appreciated in the challenge.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>I love the balance in this image.  The story it tells, or rather the mystery it creates... great contrast and tones, and brilliant use of the vignette.  I gave this a 9 and honestly expected to see it in the top 10 for the challenge.  You''re a true inspiration Ben... keep it up.</td>', 'Now I''m pretty sure I gave THIS one a MUAIMHO... so will kill two birds with one stone (MUAIMHO notification and PAW2010 comment). I''m happy to present this image with a MUAIMHO award, as I am of the opinion that it was amongst the Most Under Appreciated in the challenge.   I love the balance in this image.  The story it tells, or rather the mystery it creates... great contrast and tones, and brilliant use of the vignette.  I gave this a 9 and honestly expected to see it in the top 10 for the challenge.  You''re a true inspiration Ben... keep it up.', '2010-08-10 08:28:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6125644, 901116, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>I gave this a 9 in voting.  I love the tones and the composition, but especially love that you''ve managed to get so much detail into the image yet maintaining the minimalism required of the theme.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  I gave this a 9 in voting.  I love the tones and the composition, but especially love that you''ve managed to get so much detail into the image yet maintaining the minimalism required of the theme.', '2010-08-10 09:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6125645, 900817, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>Great composition and use of bokeh.  Detailed yet minimalistic... wonderfully balanced.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  Great composition and use of bokeh.  Detailed yet minimalistic... wonderfully balanced.', '2010-08-10 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 0),
