(6132493, 902695, 32011, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of local boy, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">HotPasta</a>''s "M e t r o p o l i s" entry a while back...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=768732" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/993/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_768732.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/993/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_768732.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/993/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_768732.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>what, with the Melbourne skyline from a helicopter (I assume) and the capitalised spaced title...  just needed to work on the post processing a bit though.<br/> <br/>I''m interested to find out who it is drawing inspiration from Enzo... I''ve been there... believe me... he''s a good mentor/role-model to have.</td>', 'Reminds me of local boy,  HotPasta''s "M e t r o p o l i s" entry a while back...   what, with the Melbourne skyline from a helicopter (I assume) and the capitalised spaced title...  just needed to work on the post processing a bit though. I''m interested to find out who it is drawing inspiration from Enzo... I''ve been there... believe me... he''s a good mentor/role-model to have.', '2010-08-17 04:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6133421, 900772, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>I can''t believe this didn''t finish top 10 in this challenge.  This was my favourite image in either of the stock photo open challenges.  Love the processing/colour, composition and great use of DOF.  The pill could have been a little sharper, and you would have had a 10 from me, but it had to settle for a 9 and this MUAIMHO.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  I can''t believe this didn''t finish top 10 in this challenge.  This was my favourite image in either of the stock photo open challenges.  Love the processing/colour, composition and great use of DOF.  The pill could have been a little sharper, and you would have had a 10 from me, but it had to settle for a 9 and this MUAIMHO.', '2010-08-18 01:13:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6133430, 901251, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>This was my favourite in the challenge, and by far the most under appreciated (imho).  Great capture and composition... and good use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  This was my favourite in the challenge, and by far the most under appreciated (imho).  Great capture and composition... and good use of B&W.', '2010-08-18 01:16:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6133437, 902964, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>Though 17th isn''t a bad finish, it is most definitely much lower than I expected it to be.  This, along with the blue ribbon winner were my highest rated images in the challenge (gave both 9).  Wonderfully composed image... beautifully balanced.  Great job... if only the voting masses would recognise the brilliance.  Rest assured that there are plenty of us that see it.  Well done.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  Though 17th isn''t a bad finish, it is most definitely much lower than I expected it to be.  This, along with the blue ribbon winner were my highest rated images in the challenge (gave both 9).  Wonderfully composed image... beautifully balanced.  Great job... if only the voting masses would recognise the brilliance.  Rest assured that there are plenty of us that see it.  Well done.', '2010-08-18 01:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6133464, 902877, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>I really like this.  It''s clever, it''s well composed... DOF might have been a little too narrow, but guess it had to be to blur the surface... just cause a bit of one of the bows to be a little OOF.  But even with this minor imperfection, it was still the highest rated (along with the other muaimho winner) photo in this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  I really like this.  It''s clever, it''s well composed... DOF might have been a little too narrow, but guess it had to be to blur the surface... just cause a bit of one of the bows to be a little OOF.  But even with this minor imperfection, it was still the highest rated (along with the other muaimho winner) photo in this challenge.  Well done.', '2010-08-18 01:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6133474, 902956, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>Beautifully composed capture.  Wonderful vision to see this, and I glad you shared it with us.  Never mind the masses (easy to say, hard to do... for me anyway... I''m forever trying to please them) and the score.  This is a great image and it is appreciated by me (and many other like me I''m sure).  This, along with the other muaimho recipient, was my highest rated image in the challenge, and most definitely deserved much more appreciation than it got.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  Beautifully composed capture.  Wonderful vision to see this, and I glad you shared it with us.  Never mind the masses (easy to say, hard to do... for me anyway... I''m forever trying to please them) and the score.  This is a great image and it is appreciated by me (and many other like me I''m sure).  This, along with the other muaimho recipient, was my highest rated image in the challenge, and most definitely deserved much more appreciation than it got.', '2010-08-18 01:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
