(6245323, 922571, 50695, '<td valign="top">Her face is covered in shadow and although the photo screams orange there''s no actual orange in it. The white balance is off, as though this were a throwaway from a fashion shoot in 1970... and not just thrown away but cut up. Surely, a Posthumous Ribbon is at hand.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Her face is covered in shadow and although the photo screams orange there''s no actual orange in it. The white balance is off, as though this were a throwaway from a fashion shoot in 1970... and not just thrown away but cut up. Surely, a Posthumous Ribbon is at hand. ', '2010-12-05 18:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
