(6247807, 923170, 50695, '<td valign="top">This picture is so authoritative. It says I AM ART. It says I AM BEAUTIFUL IN A PURELY VISUAL WAY. I recently listened to some British artist who''s a big deal over there, and she was talking about her circle paintings. Whatever gibberish she said applies better to your picture than to hers.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This picture is so authoritative. It says I AM ART. It says I AM BEAUTIFUL IN A PURELY VISUAL WAY. I recently listened to some British artist who''s a big deal over there, and she was talking about her circle paintings. Whatever gibberish she said applies better to your picture than to hers. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2010-12-07 22:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
