(6276098, 924885, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> An XPrize for you!  The glow, the pale green, the filled frame - they all combine to make a wonderfully abstract image.  It feels oppressive, yet full of light and air; an interesting combination indeed.</td>', ' An XPrize for you!  The glow, the pale green, the filled frame - they all combine to make a wonderfully abstract image.  It feels oppressive, yet full of light and air; an interesting combination indeed.', '2011-01-08 07:16:19.000000', NULL, 0),
