(6277142, 926358, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> O, clean and pure angles, one two, three.  Coming out at us, deep grain and all.  What structure can this be, we conjure magical buildings for these layers to support.</td>', ' O, clean and pure angles, one two, three.  Coming out at us, deep grain and all.  What structure can this be, we conjure magical buildings for these layers to support.', '2011-01-09 06:44:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277164, 927121, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> O, this is stunning.  Sometimes a title is descriptive, sometimes it makes no difference, but sometimes it deepens the image.  And this does the job perfectly.  The threat is both implied and imminent, and yet we willingly go into the maw.</td>', ' O, this is stunning.  Sometimes a title is descriptive, sometimes it makes no difference, but sometimes it deepens the image.  And this does the job perfectly.  The threat is both implied and imminent, and yet we willingly go into the maw.', '2011-01-09 08:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
