(6365280, 941083, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok, since I''m not voting in this challenge, and it''s driving me up the wall, I''m awarding bluebirds to my 10 favorite shots. I''ll post them in the posthumous awards thread after the challenge is over, but I just couldn''t wait until then! <br/> <br/>Intensity is a perfect title for this one. It''s very intense, yet peaceful at the same time. Love the background. Love the negative space. Very nice!! Here''s a bluebird:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Ok, since I''m not voting in this challenge, and it''s driving me up the wall, I''m awarding bluebirds to my 10 favorite shots. I''ll post them in the posthumous awards thread after the challenge is over, but I just couldn''t wait until then!  Intensity is a perfect title for this one. It''s very intense, yet peaceful at the same time. Love the background. Love the negative space. Very nice!! Here''s a bluebird: ', '2011-03-28 10:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6365285, 942052, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok. Since I can''t vote on this challenge -- I''m giving out bluebirds to my top ten favorites. I''ll post them in the posthumous thread after the challenge is over -- but I just couldn''t wait and had to start now.<br/> <br/>What a wonderful shot! I love that you included some foreground in this image. I wouldn''t have thought of it, and would have been tempted to crop it up. However, it really adds to this image and makes it as wonderful as it is!<br/> <br/>Here''s a bluebird -- and good luck in the challenge!!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Ok. Since I can''t vote on this challenge -- I''m giving out bluebirds to my top ten favorites. I''ll post them in the posthumous thread after the challenge is over -- but I just couldn''t wait and had to start now. What a wonderful shot! I love that you included some foreground in this image. I wouldn''t have thought of it, and would have been tempted to crop it up. However, it really adds to this image and makes it as wonderful as it is! Here''s a bluebird -- and good luck in the challenge!! ', '2011-03-28 10:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
