(6477207, 961914, 54645, '<td valign="top">Fantastic enegetic candid; great tones tones and filmish look. <br/> <br/>Thank you for a wonderful morning Deb. Our daughters seemingly adore you, and the images were fantastic as always. Can''t let this go by without a honorary Sterling Sturgeon for all of the above and: "remember the nice lady with the camera who ate at Ruby''s on the pier...went to Tunnel Beach with us...last summer...with the man named Lev from San Diego...remember her? When do we see her again?". <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>eta: fixed thumb<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-22 01:26:38.</i></td>', 'Fantastic enegetic candid; great tones tones and filmish look.  Thank you for a wonderful morning Deb. Our daughters seemingly adore you, and the images were fantastic as always. Can''t let this go by without a honorary Sterling Sturgeon for all of the above and: "remember the nice lady with the camera who ate at Ruby''s on the pier...went to Tunnel Beach with us...last summer...with the man named Lev from San Diego...remember her? When do we see her again?".    eta: fixed thumb', '2011-07-20 18:55:21.000000', '2011-07-22 02:26:38.000000', 1),
(6477275, 962319, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding image.  The blur and composition reminds me of Ben''s "surfer"<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=931035" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1324/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_931035.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1324/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_931035.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1324/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_931035.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Also reminds me of some of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=62357" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">salmiakki</a>''s wonderful images.  So, you''ve got yourself an excellent image here... one of my top 10 picks for the challenge.</td>', 'This is an outstanding image.  The blur and composition reminds me of Ben''s "surfer"   Also reminds me of some of  salmiakki''s wonderful images.  So, you''ve got yourself an excellent image here... one of my top 10 picks for the challenge.', '2011-07-20 20:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
