(6589742, 981774, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  One of the most beautiful B&amp;W abstracts I''ve seen for ages. Here''s an ''Order of the Thumb'' for you.  Don''t bother ducking: I''m afraid there''s no escaping it.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Lovely.  One of the most beautiful B&W abstracts I''ve seen for ages. Here''s an ''Order of the Thumb'' for you.  Don''t bother ducking: I''m afraid there''s no escaping it.', '2011-11-08 19:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6589754, 982143, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The curled toes are especially inspired.  Top three for me, which means you must now carry the awful burden of an ''Order of the Thumb''.  Sorry for you!  But thanks for a lovely photograph.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Beautiful.  The curled toes are especially inspired.  Top three for me, which means you must now carry the awful burden of an ''Order of the Thumb''.  Sorry for you!  But thanks for a lovely photograph.', '2011-11-08 19:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6589760, 982219, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is my top choice.  Lovely, thoughtful (it''s beautifully conceived, and executed with uncommon restraint), and just wonderful depth of imagery &amp; rich with quiet symbolism. It''s just superb.  10.  Thank you, and please accept an "Order of the Thumb'' which, together with just 5 bucks in cash, will entitle you to a cup of coffee.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is my top choice.  Lovely, thoughtful (it''s beautifully conceived, and executed with uncommon restraint), and just wonderful depth of imagery & rich with quiet symbolism. It''s just superb.  10.  Thank you, and please accept an "Order of the Thumb'' which, together with just 5 bucks in cash, will entitle you to a cup of coffee.', '2011-11-08 19:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
