(6605948, 984995, 54645, '<td valign="top">Keep coming back to this one. Obviously different, and will beat me to the Brown. I happen to find this fascinating. It provided a pathway to ponder vision; the shades, from black to white, forming shapes, driving thought, and encouraging imagination. A truly enjoyable experience. Cheers.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Keep coming back to this one. Obviously different, and will beat me to the Brown. I happen to find this fascinating. It provided a pathway to ponder vision; the shades, from black to white, forming shapes, driving thought, and encouraging imagination. A truly enjoyable experience. Cheers. ', '2011-11-29 19:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
