(6972924, 1051570, 114285, '<td valign="top">Much better than a few on the front page!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>oops forgot to add the thumb!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-06 00:42:30.</i></td>', 'Much better than a few on the front page!   oops forgot to add the thumb!', '2013-02-06 00:13:53.000000', '2013-02-06 00:42:30.000000', 0),
(6973590, 1050704, 100393, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1051747" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Awarded for Best Of 2012<br/> <br/> <br/>This is a new comment series for me, so please bear with me while I find my style!<br/> <br/>(Voted earlier)<br/> <br/>This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. It''s a magic moment and you John have a habit of being able to find them. I believe Don asked you before (in relation to this shot) if you were a witch. It''s a fair question!<br/> <br/>2. The compositional elements are so good as to defy the candid nature of the shot - her expression, the multiple birds, the telephone-line-perch, the curious/hopeful cat, the repeating window pattern, the strong vertical lines and the dappled render of the building.<br/> <br/>3. Your characteristic glowy sharpness is present as ever, I''ve tried to emulate and always failed. You''ve even shared the settings, but mine never look like this.<br/> <br/>4. I''m returning to the verticals - I presume you perspective corrected this - it''s made a difference; it is clean and neat.<br/> <br/>But overall, it''s the magic you bring in putting it all together. A great photo is one that is more than the sum of its parts. You manage to pull that off often, but here you have outdone yourself.<br/> <br/>Bravo.</td>', '  Awarded for Best Of 2012  This is a new comment series for me, so please bear with me while I find my style! (Voted earlier) This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. It''s a magic moment and you John have a habit of being able to find them. I believe Don asked you before (in relation to this shot) if you were a witch. It''s a fair question! 2. The compositional elements are so good as to defy the candid nature of the shot - her expression, the multiple birds, the telephone-line-perch, the curious/hopeful cat, the repeating window pattern, the strong vertical lines and the dappled render of the building. 3. Your characteristic glowy sharpness is present as ever, I''ve tried to emulate and always failed. You''ve even shared the settings, but mine never look like this. 4. I''m returning to the verticals - I presume you perspective corrected this - it''s made a difference; it is clean and neat. But overall, it''s the magic you bring in putting it all together. A great photo is one that is more than the sum of its parts. You manage to pull that off often, but here you have outdone yourself. Bravo.', '2013-02-06 15:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973919, 1051915, 114285, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant, first 10!<br/> <br/>You are the recipient of one of these <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a> well done!</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant, first 10! You are the recipient of one of these  well done!', '2013-02-06 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973920, 1052021, 114285, '<td valign="top">Incredibly good, you nailed this one!<br/> <br/>Just awesome, that stare is penetrating, it deserves this award <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a> Well done, 10!</td>', 'Incredibly good, you nailed this one! Just awesome, that stare is penetrating, it deserves this award  Well done, 10!', '2013-02-06 23:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6973928, 1050872, 114285, '<td valign="top">A masterpiece of intrigue-I actually stared at this for a long while, the PP is excellent, the clouds are awesome and the comp is perfect, all that adds up to a 10, well done.<br/> <br/>My only 10 for the challenge, and you deserve one of these, it''s outstanding in more ways than I can say!! <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'A masterpiece of intrigue-I actually stared at this for a long while, the PP is excellent, the clouds are awesome and the comp is perfect, all that adds up to a 10, well done. My only 10 for the challenge, and you deserve one of these, it''s outstanding in more ways than I can say!! ', '2013-02-07 00:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974077, 1052201, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow that is pretty awesome and something I could just imagine... he just needs to be a bit bigger, but nothing is too hard for God!<br/> <br/>Best on show <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a> 10</td>', 'Wow that is pretty awesome and something I could just imagine... he just needs to be a bit bigger, but nothing is too hard for God! Best on show  10', '2013-02-07 04:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974606, 1049705, 100393, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1051747" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Awarded for the January 2013 Free Study.<br/> <br/>This is a new comment series for me, so please bear with me while I find my style! <br/> <br/>(Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. The technical quality of the image - its crispness and clarity is perfect - that''s just a starter though.<br/> <br/>2. This image transports me - it make me feel that I''ve stepped through a time portal and this is where I have ended up. It has an uncommon level of realism.<br/> <br/>3. Part of that is down to the coloration - it''s so naturalistic; you have the saturation and contrast profiles absolutely perfect.<br/> <br/>4. The angle and POV adds much interest , it''s clearly a wide shot but avoids any distortion - again, the perspective, DOF and feel are like a camera lens has not mediated the scene. It''s eerie.<br/> <br/>5. I really like the eclectic subject matter too - so matter of fact, casual but precise.<br/> <br/>Overall, this is masterful - I don''t know how you''ve done it but you hit the sweet spot in my brain perfectly. I love it.</td>', '  Awarded for the January 2013 Free Study. This is a new comment series for me, so please bear with me while I find my style!  (Voted earlier)  This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. The technical quality of the image - its crispness and clarity is perfect - that''s just a starter though. 2. This image transports me - it make me feel that I''ve stepped through a time portal and this is where I have ended up. It has an uncommon level of realism. 3. Part of that is down to the coloration - it''s so naturalistic; you have the saturation and contrast profiles absolutely perfect. 4. The angle and POV adds much interest , it''s clearly a wide shot but avoids any distortion - again, the perspective, DOF and feel are like a camera lens has not mediated the scene. It''s eerie. 5. I really like the eclectic subject matter too - so matter of fact, casual but precise. Overall, this is masterful - I don''t know how you''ve done it but you hit the sweet spot in my brain perfectly. I love it.', '2013-02-07 18:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974757, 1051610, 114285, '<td valign="top">Has that uneasy edge about it, I''m sure intentional, an everyday event for a child, but this particular angle you shot this at, marvels me. So glad you didn''t stick to the norm, well done <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Has that uneasy edge about it, I''m sure intentional, an everyday event for a child, but this particular angle you shot this at, marvels me. So glad you didn''t stick to the norm, well done ', '2013-02-07 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
