(6978060, 1051945, 114285, '<td valign="top">What a look, this is my 2nd fave for the challenge, hope it does well, at least it looks like it''s outdoors in the real wind, unlike a lot of the other studio shot''s in here with maybe a fan blowing on them!<br/> <br/>Well done on the awesome blur and PP!<br/>You deserve one of these  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a></td>', 'What a look, this is my 2nd fave for the challenge, hope it does well, at least it looks like it''s outdoors in the real wind, unlike a lot of the other studio shot''s in here with maybe a fan blowing on them! Well done on the awesome blur and PP!You deserve one of these  ', '2013-02-12 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6978061, 1052632, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick! It''s a pleasure to view a photo of a child being outdoors on what looks like a wintery day, set up or not, so what!<br/> <br/>I really hope people disregard this unconventional processing as well, and view it for what it is!<br/> <br/>It deserves this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a> well done ;-)</td>', 'This is my top pick! It''s a pleasure to view a photo of a child being outdoors on what looks like a wintery day, set up or not, so what! I really hope people disregard this unconventional processing as well, and view it for what it is! It deserves this  well done ;-)', '2013-02-12 23:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
