(6980751, 1053203, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this as jagar''s style, but I have to say I love it. Best in show.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657188" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657188.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657188.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657188.gif"/></a></td>', 'I don''t really see this as jagar''s style, but I have to say I love it. Best in show. ', '2013-02-17 19:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
