(6982051, 1053111, 114285, '<td valign="top">FREAKISHLY AWESOME!!!<br/> <br/>I think this might have to go down as my fave pic on DPC ever!<br/> <br/>I really want to do a shot like this one day, but it doesn''t snow here, although I''ve been to places when it''s snowed, but have never actually been in the city at that time. This obviously was taken during the blizzard what an awesome replica of the time, please frame this and put it up for all to see! My only 10.<br/> <br/>Even though it''s not a cliche jagar shot, I think it'' still awesome the same<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a>all the best<br/> <br/>Edited because I  originally gave out one 10, but then ended up giving 3!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-20 00:42:29.</i></td>', 'FREAKISHLY AWESOME!!! I think this might have to go down as my fave pic on DPC ever! I really want to do a shot like this one day, but it doesn''t snow here, although I''ve been to places when it''s snowed, but have never actually been in the city at that time. This obviously was taken during the blizzard what an awesome replica of the time, please frame this and put it up for all to see! My only 10. Even though it''s not a cliche jagar shot, I think it'' still awesome the sameall the best Edited because I  originally gave out one 10, but then ended up giving 3!', '2013-02-19 23:59:24.000000', '2013-02-20 00:42:29.000000', 1),
(6982052, 1053487, 114285, '<td valign="top">Ohh to frolic in the snow again. We did this when we went to Canada, the kids loved it so much, my boy threw a snowball at me...the snow penetrated up my nose and felt like it gave me brain freeze. I never laughed so much, I couldn''t be angry at him. Thanks for all the memories, I adore this shot, the light is amazing, the tree is stunning it really makes the shot.<br/> <br/>I''m faving it!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a>adorable</td>', 'Ohh to frolic in the snow again. We did this when we went to Canada, the kids loved it so much, my boy threw a snowball at me...the snow penetrated up my nose and felt like it gave me brain freeze. I never laughed so much, I couldn''t be angry at him. Thanks for all the memories, I adore this shot, the light is amazing, the tree is stunning it really makes the shot. I''m faving it! adorable', '2013-02-19 23:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
