(7186134, 1103986, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is my only 10 - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Perfect for this challenge I think - it deserves something off the beaten path.<br/>2. It confuses - I can''t work out the relationship of the structures and people within the image - I have a suspicion, but there''s not enough information to know.<br/>3. The grain/noise - its a contributing element in its own right.<br/>4. The high contrast.<br/> <br/>Overall, a great presentation and wins my:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1051747" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>For the Best of Best of Art 2013</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is my only 10 - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Perfect for this challenge I think - it deserves something off the beaten path.2. It confuses - I can''t work out the relationship of the structures and people within the image - I have a suspicion, but there''s not enough information to know.3. The grain/noise - its a contributing element in its own right.4. The high contrast. Overall, a great presentation and wins my:   For the Best of Best of Art 2013', '2014-03-06 10:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
