(7284435, 1133529, 50695, '<td valign="top">great title. I like to think you''re punning in both time and space.<br/> <br/>for one, you''re playing with the way photos freeze time, and therefore you have created an unmoving faller. secondly, you have framed the shot so that down the stairs is also down the 2-dimensional photo.<br/> <br/>Most of my resistance to this photo is stylistic, which is very superficial, so I will overcome my resistance and give you this:<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging you in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'great title. I like to think you''re punning in both time and space. for one, you''re playing with the way photos freeze time, and therefore you have created an unmoving faller. secondly, you have framed the shot so that down the stairs is also down the 2-dimensional photo. Most of my resistance to this photo is stylistic, which is very superficial, so I will overcome my resistance and give you this:  I''m hanging you in my fantasy art gallery ', '2014-11-11 23:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
