(7412179, 1168162, 50695, '<td valign="top">7 for that great title. actually, with that title the whole thing comes alive. I''m bumping you into my gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', '7 for that great title. actually, with that title the whole thing comes alive. I''m bumping you into my gallery ', '2015-10-25 23:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412572, 1168336, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. I''m guessing this is my teammate <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=71489" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">romil</a> or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=19825" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">markwiley</a> !?<br/>Man this is great.  I love the fact that it looks like he''s holding a weapon and looks a bit questionable as far as his intentions. The drippy glass, the tattoo, the glasses, the fans, the scale - so many descriptive elements. THe red touches add a bit of foreboding. Maybe I''m morbid. But am definitely envious of his great facial hair for sure. A wonderful portrait with so much to look at.<br/>Pretty certain this will get you the blue from voters. Regardless, it gets a blue from me: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png"/></a></td>', 'This is fantastic. I''m guessing this is my teammate  romil or  markwiley !?Man this is great.  I love the fact that it looks like he''s holding a weapon and looks a bit questionable as far as his intentions. The drippy glass, the tattoo, the glasses, the fans, the scale - so many descriptive elements. THe red touches add a bit of foreboding. Maybe I''m morbid. But am definitely envious of his great facial hair for sure. A wonderful portrait with so much to look at.Pretty certain this will get you the blue from voters. Regardless, it gets a blue from me: ', '2015-10-27 11:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412573, 1168267, 38032, '<td valign="top">Superb. Love the hands, the colors and the very descriptive shot overall. Exactly what an environmental portrait should be.<br/>A jarring image leaves me red with admiration <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167385" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167385.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167385.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167385.png"/></a></td>', 'Superb. Love the hands, the colors and the very descriptive shot overall. Exactly what an environmental portrait should be.A jarring image leaves me red with admiration ', '2015-10-27 11:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7412574, 1168328, 38032, '<td valign="top">I assumed this was some sort of a setup but I''m starting to think it is not. I really have no idea. But it''s growing on me ... A big bump and a yellow from me <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167386.png"/></a></td>', 'I assumed this was some sort of a setup but I''m starting to think it is not. I really have no idea. But it''s growing on me ... A big bump and a yellow from me ', '2015-10-27 12:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
