(7414005, 1168762, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this capture and what you''ve done with it. It''s like you''re showing us their dreams of what was, or what might have been. The HDR-like processing, the crazy vignette, the flyer outstretched with a dancer''s grace, when their feet are so firmly grounded.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I like this capture and what you''ve done with it. It''s like you''re showing us their dreams of what was, or what might have been. The HDR-like processing, the crazy vignette, the flyer outstretched with a dancer''s grace, when their feet are so firmly grounded. I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2015-11-03 22:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
