(7473290, 1186899, 50695, '<td valign="top">When you remember something, you see it again,<br/>and that vision replaces the original memory.<br/>You draw a picture of a rocking horse<br/>with the legs too long, the sickle feet<br/>curving from nose to tail,<br/>and you glue it into your old family album.<br/>The glue invades the photographs <br/>like the sunlight in your backyard<br/>when you were a child, stampeding<br/>on the lawn with merciless prints,<br/>overexposed and quickly losing focus.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'When you remember something, you see it again,and that vision replaces the original memory.You draw a picture of a rocking horsewith the legs too long, the sickle feetcurving from nose to tail,and you glue it into your old family album.The glue invades the photographs like the sunlight in your backyardwhen you were a child, stampedingon the lawn with merciless prints,overexposed and quickly losing focus.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2016-09-08 17:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473291, 1186775, 50695, '<td valign="top">Varicose, bellicose, unsaturated, infatuated,<br/>metered, fettered, lettered, leaded,<br/>feted, fetid, feeble, peopled,<br/>where Lords and Puritans invented freedom together,<br/>taken by ideology left and right,<br/>walked by Shakespeare and Tyndale<br/>who gave us not theater and religion, but our very language.<br/>Oh, and Cats.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Varicose, bellicose, unsaturated, infatuated,metered, fettered, lettered, leaded,feted, fetid, feeble, peopled,where Lords and Puritans invented freedom together,taken by ideology left and right,walked by Shakespeare and Tyndalewho gave us not theater and religion, but our very language.Oh, and Cats.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2016-09-08 17:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473293, 1186926, 50695, '<td valign="top">There was a time when cappuccino was easy to identify.<br/>Never manually turn off system animations again.<br/>until it achieves an artful marble.<br/>The original Italian cappuccino consists of a single shot<br/>a kind of morning savior<br/>use stacks of coffee cups to capture other players'' coffee cups.<br/>Get brewing up a message.<br/>countable and uncountable<br/>In mouse, the cappuccino protein is part of the biogenesis of lysosome-related organelles complex 1<br/>Buy the capsules online!<br/>Create picture on a cup of coffe<br/>RADIO STATION Beirut Marina<br/>talking about coffee''s happy side on an ale label is verboton now in Amerika<br/>The perfect brown<br/>milk, eggs, fish and shellfish, sesame, sulfites, and mustard<br/>a sound mind, body and spirit are derived from food<br/>You sip slowly.<br/>an open source framework, a solid foundation<br/>A soothing sip<br/>Despite his marginal and extrovert looks, Jeremie is a shy teenager who keeps a heavy secret<br/>diving located in Thailand <br/>its supposed resemblance to that of the brown hoods of the Friars<br/>Trained to know when each drink has reached a specific weight<br/>a revolutionary way to lock your helmet<br/>a bizarre little computer<br/>Have you ever aspired to achieve perfection in something?<br/>with its jazzy atmosphere, offers something for everyone<br/>This one decides that you need an inch-thick cushion of fudgy Kahlúa-spiked ganache to soften the blow of the cappuccino cheesecake layer<br/>But if locals are to be believed, there are many other ways to fall ill, too<br/>These gooey buns are a comforting treat to prepare on your next "snow day."<br/>Where you can buy Nectar Protein<br/>I came to Zoe''s from the Alberta spay and neuter clinic to find a forever home.<br/>Barely used leaning ladder shelf<br/>With a double wrap bracelet design<br/>attractive Assam glass<br/>It is a protein_coding_gene from Drosophila melanogaster.<br/>Located 656 yards from Anne Frank House in Amsterdam<br/>a thick mass of bubbles<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'There was a time when cappuccino was easy to identify.Never manually turn off system animations again.until it achieves an artful marble.The original Italian cappuccino consists of a single shota kind of morning savioruse stacks of coffee cups to capture other players'' coffee cups.Get brewing up a message.countable and uncountableIn mouse, the cappuccino protein is part of the biogenesis of lysosome-related organelles complex 1Buy the capsules online!Create picture on a cup of coffeRADIO STATION Beirut Marinatalking about coffee''s happy side on an ale label is verboton now in AmerikaThe perfect brownmilk, eggs, fish and shellfish, sesame, sulfites, and mustarda sound mind, body and spirit are derived from foodYou sip slowly.an open source framework, a solid foundationA soothing sipDespite his marginal and extrovert looks, Jeremie is a shy teenager who keeps a heavy secretdiving located in Thailand its supposed resemblance to that of the brown hoods of the FriarsTrained to know when each drink has reached a specific weighta revolutionary way to lock your helmeta bizarre little computerHave you ever aspired to achieve perfection in something?with its jazzy atmosphere, offers something for everyoneThis one decides that you need an inch-thick cushion of fudgy Kahlúa-spiked ganache to soften the blow of the cappuccino cheesecake layerBut if locals are to be believed, there are many other ways to fall ill, tooThese gooey buns are a comforting treat to prepare on your next "snow day."Where you can buy Nectar ProteinI came to Zoe''s from the Alberta spay and neuter clinic to find a forever home.Barely used leaning ladder shelfWith a double wrap bracelet designattractive Assam glassIt is a protein_coding_gene from Drosophila melanogaster.Located 656 yards from Anne Frank House in Amsterdama thick mass of bubbles  I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2016-09-08 17:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473296, 1186940, 50695, '<td valign="top">It starts with a Kingsize bed. Then she takes a job in the next town.<br/>After a while, her shoes turn into sneakers. You can''t smell her hair.<br/>You only see her for five minutes a day when you talk about dinner.<br/>Then you only see her through windows. She is rooting for a rival sports team.<br/>She has entire bank accounts you know nothing about. And vacations.<br/>She is the poet laureate of a completely different state. She eats haluski.<br/>After a few years, you''re hearing about her children. Autism, not autism.<br/>Her voice becomes more wonderful and strange than polar bears.<br/>She''s just a picture in a book you never opened because you''re saving it for a gift<br/>for someone you haven''t met yet, who will need just the right thing.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It starts with a Kingsize bed. Then she takes a job in the next town.After a while, her shoes turn into sneakers. You can''t smell her hair.You only see her for five minutes a day when you talk about dinner.Then you only see her through windows. She is rooting for a rival sports team.She has entire bank accounts you know nothing about. And vacations.She is the poet laureate of a completely different state. She eats haluski.After a few years, you''re hearing about her children. Autism, not autism.Her voice becomes more wonderful and strange than polar bears.She''s just a picture in a book you nev