(7609909, 1231090, 163081, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition, A 9 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Awesome composition, A 9 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award', '2019-01-22 21:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609931, 1230529, 50695, '<td valign="top">It sure is green doors, and a blue ribbon.<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077284" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077284.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Funny that the photo I love the most is the one I am least able to explain. But I''ll try ... First, I think the title is right. The first thing we see are the green doors, the ones ahead of us and the ones behind us. This puts us in mind of inside and outside. Then of course we have the girl peeking at us, she is inside the car but her head pokes outside. The closed car reflects us, and more doors. The man on the other side of the car completes the symmetry of the situation. His presence makes the photographer''s reflection seem deliberate, even necessary.<br/> <br/>and also, it''s all just beautiful, plain beautiful. The pallet is simple, reds and greens, transcended by the little girls outfit and her pink sleeves. There is unexpected warmth to this street scene, as if we were indoors instead of outdoors... inside / outside.<br/> <br/>writing about this photograph, I feel like a deer trying to describe the car that hit me. the impact is so obvious to me.</td>', 'It sure is green doors, and a blue ribbon.   Funny that the photo I love the most is the one I am least able to explain. But I''ll try ... First, I think the title is right. The first thing we see are the green doors, the ones ahead of us and the ones behind us. This puts us in mind of inside and outside. Then of course we have the girl peeking at us, she is inside the car but her head pokes outside. The closed car reflects us, and more doors. The man on the other side of the car completes the symmetry of the situation. His presence makes the photographer''s reflection seem deliberate, even necessary. and also, it''s all just beautiful, plain beautiful. The pallet is simple, reds and greens, transcended by the little girls outfit and her pink sleeves. There is unexpected warmth to this street scene, as if we were indoors instead of outdoors... inside / outside. writing about this photograph, I feel like a deer trying to describe the car that hit me. the impact is so obvious to me.', '2019-01-22 23:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609932, 1230521, 50695, '<td valign="top">you''ve created a spectacular silhouette<br/> <br/>I feel like this is going to get plenty ribboned without me but I can''t ignore it.<br/> <br/>i''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I assume this is a combination of images. The perspective just doesn''t make visual sense. It makes more of a metaphorical sense, considering that compositionally her silhouette is perfectly placed amid the soaring towers. And what a great silhouette: no arms, bubbly shoes, boxy dress, and impossible hair, her stride so deliberate.</td>', 'you''ve created a spectacular silhouette I feel like this is going to get plenty ribboned without me but I can''t ignore it. i''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery   I assume this is a combination of images. The perspective just doesn''t make visual sense. It makes more of a metaphorical sense, considering that compositionally her silhouette is perfectly placed amid the soaring towers. And what a great silhouette: no arms, bubbly shoes, boxy dress, and impossible hair, her stride so deliberate.', '2019-01-22 23:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609934, 1230390, 50695, '<td valign="top">a magnificent windshield effect. the headlights are like eyes opening the darkness<br/> <br/>this is so stirring that I''m hanging it in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Maybe your title is coloring my perception, but this reminds me of Yeats'' rough beast. The world is melting into a single creature. I love the slight details above the fence that are still recognizable, roofs and trees. Not just recognizable, but buildable. Our brain builds the rest of the scene, and puts our own past there, to be swallowed up by apocalypse.</td>', 'a magnificent windshield effect. the headlights are like eyes opening the darkness this is so stirring that I''m hanging it in my fantasy gallery   Maybe your title is coloring my perception, but this reminds me of Yeats'' rough beast. The world is melting into a single creature. I love the slight details above the fence that are still recognizable, roofs and trees. Not just recognizable, but buildable. Our brain builds the rest of the scene, and puts our own past there, to be swallowed up by apocalypse.', '2019-01-22 23:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7610720, 1231268, 163081, '<td valign="top">best in show. I give you a 9 and my Blue Dragon Award<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173261" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg"/></a> <br/>(I don''t think that texture was needed)</td>', 'best in show. I give you a 9 and my Blue Dragon Award (I don''t think that texture was needed)', '2019-01-27 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611010, 1231423, 50695, '<td valign="top">oh yes the beauty of barely there.<br/> <br/>I''m pretty sure those diagonals in the foreground are framing a roof. They are a strong unexpected visual element that pulls the whole image together. I feel like I''m on a boat in the fog. I feel like the world is a boat.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'oh yes the beauty of barely there. I''m pretty sure those diagonals in the foreground are framing a roof. They are a strong unexpected visual element that pulls the whole image together. I feel like I''m on a boat in the fog. I feel like the world is a boat. I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2019-01-29 18:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611011, 1231119, 50695, '<td valign="top">there are several visual tricks going on here. The foreshortened feathers echo the bokeh. The bird looks like it''s chained by the leg. The bokeh obliterates the sense of depth and looks more like a curtain directly behind the bird,, which in turn makes the bird''s perch look like a stage or a pedestal. I''m reminded of King Kong performing on Broadway. It''s an absurd photo, but also absurdly entertaining.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'there are several visual tricks going on here. The foreshortened feathers echo the bokeh. The bird looks like it''s chained by the leg. The bokeh obliterates the sense of depth and looks more like a curtain directly behind the bird,, which in turn makes the bird''s perch look like a stage or a pedestal. I''m reminded of King Kong performing on Broadway. It''s an absurd photo, but also absurdly entertaining.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2019-01-29 18:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611012, 1230749, 50695, '<td valign="top">a shot like this, which is naturally appealing because of high contrast with lots of black and good texture, needs a couple of extra elements to make it really special. In this case, the winner is the man''s pose, specifically the way he is looking down and how this echoes the downsloping chairbacks on the right. the symbolic well on the ground doesn''t hurt, either.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'a shot like this, which is naturally appealing because of high contrast with lots of black and good texture, needs a couple of extra elements to make it really special. In this case, the winner is the man''s pose, specifically the way he is looking down and how this echoes the downsloping chairbacks on the right. the symbolic well on the ground doesn''t hurt, either.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2019-01-29 18:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
